{"seq":2,"slug":"protocol-extensions","title":"协议扩展","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/swift-language-advanced/protocols/protocol-extensions","wordCount":990,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"协议扩展\">协议扩展</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>协议扩展（Protocol Extension）是 Swift 面向协议编程的基石。它允许为协议提供方法、计算属性和下标的<strong>默认实现</strong>，使遵循类型无需重复编写样板代码。然而，协议扩展中的方法分派机制——静态分派 vs 动态分派——是 Swift 中最容易引起混淆的知识点之一。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    PE[&quot;协议扩展&quot;] --&gt; DI[&quot;默认实现&quot;]&#10;    PE --&gt; CP[&quot;定制点&quot;]&#10;    PE --&gt; SD[&quot;分派机制&quot;]&#10;    SD --&gt; STATIC[&quot;静态分派(扩展独有方法)&quot;]&#10;    SD --&gt; DYNAMIC[&quot;动态分派(协议要求方法)&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    PE[\"协议扩展\"] --&gt; DI[\"默认实现\"]\n    PE --&gt; CP[\"定制点\"]\n    PE --&gt; SD[\"分派机制\"]\n    SD --&gt; STATIC[\"静态分派(扩展独有方法)\"]\n    SD --&gt; DYNAMIC[\"动态分派(协议要求方法)\"]</pre><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>协议扩展（<code>extension SomeProtocol</code>）允许在协议本身之外，为协议添加<strong>方法、计算属性和下标的默认实现</strong>，让遵循类型按需覆盖而不是全部手写。它之所以是 Swift 面向协议编程的基石，是因为默认实现让「协议」具备了传统「基类」的代码复用能力，却不受单继承限制。关键在于理解以下概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>默认实现</strong>——扩展里的实现作为遵循类型的兜底，遵循类型可覆盖其中一部分；</li>\n<li><strong>分派机制</strong>——<strong>协议要求中声明</strong>的方法走动态分派（调用具体类型实现），<strong>仅在扩展中添加</strong>的方法走静态分派（按编译时类型调用），这是 Swift 最易混淆的知识点；</li>\n<li><strong>定制点（Customization Points）</strong>——把可覆盖的方法声明进协议要求，把复合逻辑放进扩展，实现「只覆盖需要定制的部分」；</li>\n<li><strong>条件扩展</strong>——用 <code>where</code> 子句让扩展只对满足条件的类型生效。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一句话概括：<strong>协议扩展提供复用，而方法是否写进协议要求决定了它能否被动态覆盖。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"默认实现\">默认实现</h2><p>协议扩展可以为协议的所有方法提供默认实现：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"protocol Greetable {&#10;    var name: String { get }&#10;    func greet() -&gt; String&#10;}&#10;&#10;extension Greetable {&#10;    func greet() -&gt; String {&#10;        &quot;Hello, \\(name)!&quot;&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;struct Person: Greetable {&#10;    let name: String&#10;}&#10;&#10;struct Robot: Greetable {&#10;    let name: String&#10;&#10;    func greet() -&gt; String {&#10;        &quot;Beep boop, I am \\(name).&quot;&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;let person = Person(name: &quot;Alice&quot;)&#10;let robot = Robot(name: &quot;R2D2&quot;)&#10;print(person.greet()) // Hello, Alice!&#10;print(robot.greet())  // Beep boop, I am R2D2.\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">protocol</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Greetable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> name: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> greet</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">extension</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Greetable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> greet</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"Hello, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\\(name)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">!\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Person</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Greetable </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> name: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Robot</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Greetable </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> name: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> greet</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"Beep boop, I am </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\\(name)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> person </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Person</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Alice\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> robot </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Robot</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"R2D2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(person.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">greet</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()) </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Hello, Alice!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(robot.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">greet</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">())  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Beep boop, I am R2D2.</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>Person</code> 使用默认实现，<code>Robot</code> 提供了自定义实现来覆盖默认行为。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"静态分派-vs-动态分派\">静态分派 vs 动态分派</h2><p>这是协议扩展中最关键的概念。<strong>协议要求中声明的方法</strong>使用动态分派，<strong>仅在扩展中添加的方法</strong>使用静态分派：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"protocol Describable {&#10;    func describe() -&gt; String&#10;}&#10;&#10;extension Describable {&#10;    func describe() -&gt; String {&#10;        &quot;I am Describable&quot;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    func detailedDescription() -&gt; String {&#10;        &quot;Detail: \\(describe())&quot;&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;struct Cat: Describable {&#10;    func describe() -&gt; String {&#10;        &quot;I am a Cat&quot;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    func detailedDescription() -&gt; String {&#10;        &quot;Cat Detail: meow&quot;&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;let cat = Cat()&#10;let describable: any Describable = cat&#10;&#10;print(cat.describe())                    // I am a Cat&#10;print(describable.describe())            // I am a Cat ✅ 动态分派&#10;&#10;print(cat.detailedDescription())         // Cat Detail: meow&#10;print(describable.detailedDescription()) // Detail: I am a Cat ⚠️ 静态分派\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">protocol</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Describable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> describe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">extension</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Describable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> describe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"I am Describable\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> detailedDescription</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"Detail: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\\(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">describe</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">())</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Cat</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Describable </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> describe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"I am a Cat\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> detailedDescription</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"Cat Detail: meow\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cat </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Cat</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> describable: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Describable </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cat</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cat.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">describe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">())                    </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// I am a Cat</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(describable.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">describe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">())            </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// I am a Cat ✅ 动态分派</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cat.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">detailedDescription</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">())         </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Cat Detail: meow</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(describable.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">detailedDescription</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()) </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Detail: I am a Cat ⚠️ 静态分派</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>分派方式</th>\n<th>行为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>协议要求中声明 + 扩展提供默认</td>\n<td>动态分派</td>\n<td>调用具体类型的实现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>仅在扩展中添加（非协议要求）</td>\n<td>静态分派</td>\n<td>按编译时类型调用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    MC[&quot;方法调用&quot;] --&gt; Q{&quot;方法在协议要求中声明？&quot;}&#10;    Q --&gt;|是| DYN[&quot;动态分派 → 具体类型实现&quot;]&#10;    Q --&gt;|否| STA[&quot;静态分派 → 编译时类型实现&quot;]&#10;    DYN --&gt; PWT[&quot;通过 Protocol Witness Table&quot;]&#10;    STA --&gt; DIR[&quot;直接调用扩展方法&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    MC[\"方法调用\"] --&gt; Q{\"方法在协议要求中声明？\"}\n    Q --&gt;|是| DYN[\"动态分派 → 具体类型实现\"]\n    Q --&gt;|否| STA[\"静态分派 → 编译时类型实现\"]\n    DYN --&gt; PWT[\"通过 Protocol Witness Table\"]\n    STA --&gt; DIR[\"直接调用扩展方法\"]</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 这个分派规则是 Swift 中最常见的&quot;意外行为&quot;来源。如果你希望子类型能够覆盖某个方法，<strong>必须在协议声明中列出该方法</strong>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"定制点-customization-points\">定制点（Customization Points）</h2><p>利用分派机制可以设计&quot;定制点&quot;模式——在协议要求中声明可定制方法，在扩展中提供包含定制点调用的复合方法：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"protocol Renderer {&#10;    func renderHeader() -&gt; String&#10;    func renderBody() -&gt; String&#10;    func renderFooter() -&gt; String&#10;}&#10;&#10;extension Renderer {&#10;    func renderHeader() -&gt; String { &quot;&lt;header/&gt;&quot; }&#10;    func renderBody() -&gt; String { &quot;&lt;body/&gt;&quot; }&#10;    func renderFooter() -&gt; String { &quot;&lt;footer/&gt;&quot; }&#10;&#10;    func render() -&gt; String {&#10;        &quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;        \\(renderHeader())&#10;        \\(renderBody())&#10;        \\(renderFooter())&#10;        &quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;struct HTMLRenderer: Renderer {&#10;    func renderBody() -&gt; String {&#10;        &quot;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Custom HTML&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&quot;&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;let renderer = HTMLRenderer()&#10;print(renderer.render())\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">protocol</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Renderer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> renderHeader</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> renderBody</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> renderFooter</span><sp